<section class="slide">
  <div class="fit">
  <div class="eyebrow"><span>09 · Results</span><span class="dim">training</span></div>
  <h1>Both arms, DPO, 800 steps @ batch 64</h1>
  <p class="sub">Same data, same β, same steps, same effective batch, same seed. The only intended difference is <code>--peft_method</code>; the learning rates were tuned separately under an equal budget.</p>
  <div class="body">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th></th><th class="num">LoRA · lr 5e-6</th><th class="num">Prefix · lr 5e-5</th><th>Reading</th></tr></thead>
